{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:65592b1ef6033340c69326e77ecd9f3222edaf5c771a2a43ed3057f566491ef1",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c391997b55a2964fa0fc166f4cc2e2a84ff43baeb6237ada6e314982654dd101",
      "text": "工作中",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d3e8fa043af75a87dd4faef01ce8885090903c7489ecb33e70005fc16c71c5",
      "text": "【剧情梗概】",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:33d8451285d4e5f69626e1f5771ddc007ba751ec655f29067561078d2496c78f",
      "text": "工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2a5f2637d32f6d29d37d442affb15064f13aa47c7ca089ed73dae585a3fbd00",
      "text": "企划露营用品的工作",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a7b9053901732f0e0e8e22752219a37cb089aeb84fcbeb436067ce46ba12409",
      "text": "…这份工作似乎能发挥我的爱好呢。\n●●●●プロデューサー，谢谢你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:924d9a0299978c4d13afdf2e09540a5d6b8cc65624cacbbd0acdc02756fb0a4f",
      "text": "是啊。和露营用品厂商的联名合作，\n我觉得非常适合一希先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dd941adf8f763a0095a700e02dcd33613788eb9f7917ffe4e6283ec1427104ba",
      "text": "…能通过联名企划参与周边产品的制作，\n之前完全没想过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:842b028033661236c8a993b05cee4b507b7b3a036a89d2d96b37f16f690d7cb1",
      "text": "（…大家所追求的是什么样的物品呢。\n是注重设计，还是注重性能。抑或是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b0a6ec1350acb4b3879e6c46100cef2a913a4be157d6d1593cfee9fa72df6de3",
      "text": "资料上写着，希望一希先生来决定\n周边是做面向初学者还是面向熟练者的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ead0ff867ce7dfc22fbd6ead05e51e342ec9e7d38873c92b9f947ff73bbf6b77",
      "text": "…那样的话，面向初学者的比较好。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e9a40afe48634ce84fa91597278c812d42dfdc5156852288f8c404a8a0a10c7",
      "text": "…我希望能以联名周边为契机，\n让大家对露营产生兴趣……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56f4220c47d4c8b66806dbd33e730d879af78e77d554659befb2921bcbb9a55b",
      "text": "…●●●●プロデューサー怎么看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec4985d36557b75edba1bd92e11d037aeec9b41ac1b993bcd668aee8eb3025f0",
      "text": "主题很明确，我觉得是个很棒的方案。\n就按这个方向来吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_5_043kaz_1_5_043_03:1_5_043_03:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:28be6c05a57893cd1b14188fd34ff3d9d61064b47ce3bf790862a65210157485",
      "text": "…嗯。那我这就去把方案整理出来。\n要是有什么意见请不用客气尽管提。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
